Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:06.23,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What was that all about, Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.23,0:00:08.11,CRKokoro,TaiIna,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Iori is mine!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.11,0:00:10.40,CRKokoro,TaiIna,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Stay away from her!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:13.57,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,There is no reason for you to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.99,0:00:17.66,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I made it clear that you \Nand Fujishima are rivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.66,0:00:19.63,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,If you work hard enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.63,0:00:22.96,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,you can rescue Iori from \NFujishima's clutches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:25.30,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I set the scene for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:29.84,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to turn a \Nclassmate into an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:33.84,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone but you yourself is an enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:34.78,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.55,0:00:36.84,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Say, Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:39.76,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you in love with Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:42.02,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.42,0:02:16.15,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm in love with Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.30,0:02:19.66,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.01,0:02:23.78,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You've started to overreact \Nto everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:26.16,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I recall you being more of a stoic lump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:29.09,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That's because the circumstances I've \Nbeen dealing with force me to!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.09,0:02:34.67,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm telling you to bag Iori before \NFujishima beats you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.67,0:02:36.69,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you keep pushing \Nme in that direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.69,0:02:39.34,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,And Fujishima's a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:44.93,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Facing adversity to save someone \Nfits you perfectly, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:46.43,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.64,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Selfless freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:57.03,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:02:58.87,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:02.79,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you volunteer for \Nthis painful exercise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:06.91,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Nobody else wanted to participate, \Nso I had to volunteer
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.22,0:03:10.87,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,to make sure that no one \Nelse would have to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.87,0:03:14.92,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Which confirms that you're \Na selfless freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:18.10,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you like pro wrestling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.48,0:03:19.80,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,It's the art of enduring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.15,0:03:23.46,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,In pro wrestling, it's not about who can
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:25.90,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,perform stronger and flashier moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.90,0:03:28.17,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Special moves can only be performed on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:29.77,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,opponents who are able to endure them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:34.81,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a big fan of jobbers, who \Nlet themselves get beat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:37.57,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Shut the hell up, wrestling fanboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:39.79,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You asked for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.79,0:03:41.66,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,So, back to Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:43.01,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Have you noticed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:46.62,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,She's the weakest link in StuCS.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.52,0:03:49.99,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen anyone so close
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.99,0:03:51.96,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,to completely breaking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.79,0:03:55.57,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that what you're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.57,0:04:00.37,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,She needs someone to shield \Nher from the pain and hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:05.22,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like a job for the \Nselfless freak, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.16,0:04:08.16,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't put words in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:09.97,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I've never looked at her in that light.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:14.81,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I should probably mention that \NIori's in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:17.06,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Nah, that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.39,0:04:19.69,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Weak reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:22.90,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,She needs someone to cling to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:27.07,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Someone who will be there to \Nunconditionally support her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:32.08,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, you and Iori come \Nalive when you're together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:33.66,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.17,0:04:36.72,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's your problem to work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.72,0:04:38.35,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:40.95,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.47,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I have a feeling that Iori's \Nin the most danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.47,0:04:45.62,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:48.68,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,This personality swapping business
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.66,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,could break any one of us eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:54.98,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,but she's the one who's taking the \Nbrunt of the adverse effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.98,0:04:56.64,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Adverse effects...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.13,0:05:00.81,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But so far, we've only had to \Ndeal with a few minor hiccups.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.81,0:05:02.99,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have to be \Nso serious about it—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:04.19,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Are you an idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:07.28,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,How can you be so optimistic?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.84,0:05:09.40,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,There's no question,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.40,0:05:12.33,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,you're the most clueless one in our group!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.33,0:05:14.98,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Do you realize how hopeless \Nour current situation is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:18.29,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,At any moment, any one of us could \Nbe seriously hurt, completely broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:22.05,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:24.80,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:27.26,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.37,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,No, I was too harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.89,0:05:33.56,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I've been feeling grouchy after \Neverything that's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:35.38,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.11,0:05:39.39,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Can you forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:42.33,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing to forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:46.35,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You're absolutely right. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.91,0:05:53.60,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, let's get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:55.44,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,We'll never finish at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:57.29,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You're completely clueless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.29,0:05:58.28,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:02.71,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Your trash bag was blown \Naway by the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:03.30,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:06.32,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Why didn't you say something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:07.30,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:09.63,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.47,0:06:13.51,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,It was more entertaining this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:18.81,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:21.38,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm always yelling at you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:23.51,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,because I don't want to \Nadmit how I truly feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.51,0:06:24.57,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,but deep down...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.19,0:06:28.94,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Deep down, I truly love you, Aoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.94,0:06:31.52,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry about springing \Nthis on you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:36.30,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,But I can't continue to lie to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:38.08,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Please go out with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:40.26,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Did you record it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.89,0:06:41.83,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:43.47,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:44.63,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:49.33,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, I kinda...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:51.72,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.92,0:06:54.15,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,I like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:58.23,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,So would you please go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:07:00.43,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yup, that was good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.43,0:07:02.39,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,I felt a twinge when I saw
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.39,0:07:05.80,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,the sharp, manly Inaba-chan \Nconfess like a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:09.00,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,The first recording was probably \Ntaken from one of your fantasies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.00,0:07:10.11,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:14.99,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Man, I hope I can get her \Nto say those words one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:18.37,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that should be enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:19.83,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll delete the video.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:22.51,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, we're just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:25.45,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's take a few more \Nshots before the girls
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.45,0:07:27.17,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,come back from shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:30.45,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,We may never get a chance \Nlike this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:31.30,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:34.18,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.60,CRKokoro,AokiIn,0000,0000,0000,,Yui! Grab the cell phones!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:37.39,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,I'm on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.11,0:07:49.19,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard to move around in this body!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:52.86,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Taichi, you need to exercise more!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:56.96,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}W-Well, I kinda...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:59.37,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}U-Um...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.51,0:08:01.76,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I like you!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.76,0:08:05.55,CRKokoro,InaTai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}So would you please go out with me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:09.25,CRKokoro,AokiIna,0000,0000,0000,,I see that you boys were having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:14.76,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Um, Inaba? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:20.77,CRKokoro,AokiIna,0000,0000,0000,,I'm getting ready to run \Naround campus buck naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.59,0:08:24.52,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,P-Please stop, Inaba-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:27.77,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,If you do that, you'll be killing \Nany chance I have of leading
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:29.44,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,a normal life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:31.03,CRKokoro,AokiIna,0000,0000,0000,,Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:33.53,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.53,0:08:36.21,CRKokoro,YuiAoki,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba-san! If you kill my \Nchances at a normal life,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:38.87,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,I may have to kill myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.87,0:08:41.00,CRKokoro,AokiIna,0000,0000,0000,,Silence! This is the \Npunishment you deserve!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:47.29,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Don't expect to survive \Nif you try that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:48.07,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.07,0:08:49.42,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,We're very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:52.37,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just as mad as she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.37,0:08:54.30,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I'll beat the crap out of \Nyou if you try that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:55.91,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:58.05,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Iori isn't here yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.05,0:09:01.06,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, she had to leave \Nearly for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.37,0:09:02.99,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.99,0:09:05.09,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I've been wondering about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:08.65,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yui-san, are you scared of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:11.36,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Every time I'm Yui,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:15.20,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I start to shake whenever \Nthere's a man around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.51,0:09:27.58,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,That's nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:32.09,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Why should I be scared \Nof a couple weaklings...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.08,0:09:34.15,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,...like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.89,0:09:36.71,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,U-Uh, Yui...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.94,0:09:42.35,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,After all, I'm way stronger \Nthan you guys are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:43.81,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.25,0:09:47.44,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,So men don't scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:52.15,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:54.90,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I kept telling you how I loved you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:56.53,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,but I never realized that \Nyou were hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.09,0:10:00.82,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm such a big idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:04.77,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yui!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.71,0:10:06.97,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.33,0:10:11.42,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go help her calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.85,0:10:13.27,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:14.17,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:15.80,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:18.47,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,She was good at concealing her fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.94,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,so I can't blame you for not noticing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:24.10,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But she's got it pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:30.91,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I can help her get back on her feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.26,0:10:33.98,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You guys will have to \Ntake it from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.46,0:10:41.14,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I hate myself now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.14,0:10:42.69,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be too hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.69,0:10:46.05,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Her acting was good enough \Nto impress Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:49.96,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, I didn't notice anything \Nwhen I was Kiriyama...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.13,0:10:53.75,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,But in retrospect, there were signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.23,0:10:56.05,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,When you look at StuCS,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:58.41,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba-chan is always mad
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.41,0:11:00.88,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,and beats us up all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:04.29,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Iori-chan likes to touch people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:07.06,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yui is an active girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:12.73,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,so it seemed odd that \Nshe never joined in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.73,0:11:15.02,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You're pretty perceptive, Aoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.59,0:11:18.38,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,We're talking about the girl I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:21.25,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You're still the same person you were,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:26.04,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,even after this whole \Npersonality swapping mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.68,0:11:32.04,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,My policy is to enjoy life as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:34.66,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,That's all I expect,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.66,0:11:36.00,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,and that will never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.31,0:11:39.33,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,So I'm hoping that we'll be able to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:43.81,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,look back at this body swapping \Nand laugh, one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.37,0:11:45.97,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,But that doesn't seem likely anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.49,0:11:48.51,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,now that I've hurt Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:52.59,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I getting all serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.59,0:11:54.20,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.20,0:11:57.82,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starting to think that \Nyou could really go places.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:00.32,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:05.22,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You know, I think you have a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:07.87,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,better chance with Yui than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:10.40,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You were saying nice \Nthings about me earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:14.06,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,but you have way more \Npotential than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.34,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of potential \Nare we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:20.12,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you're pretty clueless, \Nso you haven't realized
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.12,0:12:21.60,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,how incredible you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.01,0:12:25.59,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I have no idea where to go from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:29.67,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, how can we help Kiriyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.16,0:12:31.33,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.33,0:12:33.46,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,That's what makes you incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.46,0:12:35.40,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You're thinking about how to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:36.86,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You think on a higher level.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:41.25,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's not like I \Nhave any great ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:44.59,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,It's scary because I can \Nsee you pulling it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:49.67,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,But if that happens, Yui \Nmight fall for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:50.44,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:53.62,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I need to call Yui and apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.72,0:12:56.88,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Taichi, I won't let you beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:02.26,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:09.39,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. If that's what you want, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.85,0:13:19.65,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like this group?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.03,0:13:21.69,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,Hm, they're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:24.45,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, there's a pro wrestling \Nspecial on tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:26.07,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,After this show is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:27.70,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:49.47,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Kiriyama...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:56.24,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, is this Kiriyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:14:00.92,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, I was probably crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.92,0:14:02.46,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,but don't let it concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.31,0:14:04.57,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, just forget it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.02,0:14:08.57,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Kiriyama, can we meet up somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:14.10,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I kinda went into a panic,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.10,0:14:16.12,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,so your sister was a little freaked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.61,0:14:19.51,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,She's been confused by my behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:20.96,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.91,0:14:26.91,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Aoki called me right before we switched.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:28.61,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,He kept apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:30.64,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.27,0:14:35.29,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,I realized that you and Aoki would
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:38.61,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,probably start tiptoeing around me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.27,0:14:42.90,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,so we wouldn't be able to have \Nfun the way we used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.34,0:14:46.75,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,That thought made me \Nfeel sorry for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:50.53,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Kiriyama, do you suffer \Nfrom androphobia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:52.63,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:14:55.42,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,There must have been a cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:58.29,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Could you tell me what that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:15:02.28,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,I should have known you would \Nget straight to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.47,0:15:08.26,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,You're the second person I've talked \Nto about this, after Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:15.77,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Back when I was in middle \Nschool, I was almost raped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.77,0:15:19.05,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing happened though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.05,0:15:20.81,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,I fought back and managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.39,0:15:25.22,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Still, this was back when I \Npracticed karate every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.22,0:15:27.88,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,I won against every man I faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.88,0:15:30.16,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,I was convinced that I could fend off
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.16,0:15:31.45,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,anyone who attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:35.14,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,But when it really happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.14,0:15:36.93,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,I barely managed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:38.81,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.81,0:15:42.23,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,Men are incredibly strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.94,0:15:45.09,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,That's when I realized
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.90,0:15:49.17,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,that I wouldn't be able \Nto fight off a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.86,0:15:53.25,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kiriyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:56.10,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:15:58.85,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,I'd rather not say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:00.82,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,I want to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.82,0:16:01.90,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:05.03,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,If I say anything to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:08.23,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be asking for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.24,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:15.37,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to cause \Nother people trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.73,0:16:22.65,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Personally, I think you'll be \Nmore trouble as long as you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.65,0:16:24.04,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,have androphobia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:26.36,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,How can you say that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:27.89,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to live like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.89,0:16:28.63,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:30.64,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Then let me help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:32.61,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want to live like this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:34.13,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,That's what you said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:41.52,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to teach you the \Nway to defeat any man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:44.31,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're kinda scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.31,0:16:45.77,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Just watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:48.84,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Grab me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:09.80,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That hurts just to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.29,0:17:11.71,CRKokoro,TaiYui,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:13.80,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,But now you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:16.09,CRKokoro,YuiTai,0000,0000,0000,,One blow is all it takes to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:19.79,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:23.23,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:30.43,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I've never been in more pain in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.44,0:17:32.73,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:36.38,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Taichi, someone's \Nwalking this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.02,0:17:39.53,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, shouldn't we hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:43.33,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,It could be annoying if anyone sees us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:45.65,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:48.54,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm finished...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:51.42,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Stop trying to play hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:53.30,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, that wasn't my intention.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.18,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Um, excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.18,0:17:58.36,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.36,0:18:00.35,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Geez! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.95,0:18:10.14,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Ki-Kiriyama, this should be far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.14,0:18:12.18,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:15.52,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,No way. When did I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.52,0:18:17.95,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't seem to have a problem doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:20.37,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,That's because I was desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:22.45,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, it's just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.01,0:18:25.57,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, what was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.58,0:18:28.29,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Why should a girl have to \Nexperience the pain of a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:30.38,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But it worked, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:33.04,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I guess, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.04,0:18:36.60,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Does that work on every man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:39.79,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's not just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.79,0:18:41.14,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:45.33,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,That kind of pain would \Nleave them paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:48.23,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,One blow is all I need to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:54.90,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I'll practice at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:19:00.13,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Have I created some kind of \Nterrible melee weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.13,0:19:04.71,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Say, why did you do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.71,0:19:07.10,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,You even hurt yourself in the process.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:09.16,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Can't I just want to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.70,0:19:12.17,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds like something you would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:27.81,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:33.06,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yaegashi-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:37.60,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Were you with a girl in the \NDistrict 5 park last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.60,0:19:39.19,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.55,0:19:42.90,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Were you the person I saw struggling
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.90,0:19:46.36,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,with a small girl with long hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:50.71,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I always pass that park \Nwhen I walk our dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.71,0:19:53.14,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You've got the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:55.99,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:19:58.82,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I may have been seeing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:00.93,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I apologize for the false accusation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:04.72,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,And here I was thinking I'd caught \Nyou in the act of cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.47,0:20:11.08,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,'Sup, Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:12.78,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kiriyama...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.79,0:20:16.64,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.64,0:20:18.53,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,C-Could you stop that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:22.76,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Guess what, Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.92,0:20:28.83,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I might get back into martial \Narts and pro wrestling,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:30.95,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,so tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:32.89,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.89,0:20:34.22,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,How about right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:35.96,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Not right now. Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:37.70,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:39.21,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I need to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:45.62,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You can move on, Kiriyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.60,0:20:48.99,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:49.97,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.97,0:20:52.93,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen between \Nthe two of you last night?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.93,0:20:54.01,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,That must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.01,0:20:56.77,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I-It wasn't anything special.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.77,0:20:59.73,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I just gave her a little advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:04.15,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:05.86,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,It's definitely my business!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:09.70,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,How are you guys so close \Nafter one conversation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.70,0:21:12.36,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, let's have a \Nstrategy meeting, Iori-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.36,0:21:15.11,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,What? But it's none of my business!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:18.57,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.57,0:21:21.63,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it really wasn't anything special.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.04,0:21:25.38,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I just gave Kiriyama a little push.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:29.97,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I guess this personality \Nswapping business
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.97,0:21:32.23,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,can actually do some good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:37.21,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I was convinced that \Nit would destroy us...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:38.65,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:43.69,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:45.30,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.45,0:21:47.33,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.33,0:21:48.56,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.56,0:21:49.56,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:56.99,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to know \Nmore about me, Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.99,0:21:58.72,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,You need to take care of your own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.72,0:22:01.00,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,I thought he might be responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:02.35,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Am I your enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.35,0:22:05.92,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,It's stupid that I'm actually touched.
